---
---

<section id="filosofia" class="py-24 bg-white overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl mb-6">
          Equilibrio entre <br />Razón y Emoción.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          En Benai, creemos que el mejor software nace de la intersección entre una ingeniería impecable y una comprensión profunda de las necesidades humanas.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-1 bg-[#0071E3] rounded-full h-auto"></div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Tomás Felice</h4>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-[#0071E3] uppercase tracking-wider">CTO & Tech Lead</span>
              <p class="mt-2 text-gray-500 text-sm">Asegura la robustez. Arquitectura escalable, seguridad y código limpio para cimientos sólidos.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-1 bg-gray-900 rounded-full h-auto"></div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Candela Dagrosa</h4>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-[#0071E3] uppercase tracking-wider">CPO & Product Lead</span>
              <p class="mt-2 text-gray-500 text-sm">Define la experiencia. Traduce necesidades de negocio en funcionalidades intuitivas y productos amigables.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <!-- Abstract visual representation of logic + design -->
        <div class="aspect-square rounded-3xl bg-gray-50 flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-gray-100 to-white"></div>
          <div class="w-3/4 h-3/4 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl absolute top-8 left-8 z-10 bg-white shadow-xl flex flex-col p-6">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 mb-4"></div>
            <div class="w-full h-2 bg-gray-100 rounded mb-2"></div>
            <div class="w-2/3 h-2 bg-gray-100 rounded mb-8"></div>
            <div class="flex-1 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg border border-dashed border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400 text-xs">
              Wireframe / Logic
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-3/4 h-3/4 bg-[#1d1d1f] rounded-2xl absolute bottom-8 right-8 shadow-2xl flex flex-col p-6 text-white transform hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-500">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#0071E3] mb-4"></div>
            <div class="w-full h-2 bg-gray-700 rounded mb-2"></div>
            <div class="w-2/3 h-2 bg-gray-700 rounded mb-8"></div>
            <div class="flex-1 bg-gray-800 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-gray-500 text-xs">
              Final Product
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
